tsinferR bundles the following third-party code in src/. License texts are in
inst/licenses/.

src/tsinfer/   The tsinfer C library (ancestor builder and Li & Stephens
               matcher), Copyright (C) 2018-2026 University of Oxford,
               GNU General Public License version 3 or later.
               Modified: rename of a C++-reserved parameter name in avl.h,
               8-byte alignment in tsi_blkalloc.c, bug fixes (allocation size,
               input validation, error message).

src/tskit/, src/tskit.h
               The tskit C library 1.3.1, Copyright (c) 2018-2025 Tskit
               Developers, MIT License (inst/licenses/tskit.txt).
               Modified: internal assertion failures are routed to R's error
               handler, the debug stream is disabled, zero-length memory
               operations are guarded, and a designated initializer is made
               C++17-compatible.

src/kastore/   kastore 2.1.3, Copyright (c) 2018-2025 Tskit Developers,
               MIT License (inst/licenses/tskit.txt). Modified as tskit.

