               2019-present The Blosc Development Team, BSD 3-Clause License
               (inst/licenses/c-blosc.txt); BloscLZ derives from FastLZ
               (inst/licenses/blosclz.txt). Modified: a compile-time
               #warning was removed, generic shuffle helpers are marked
               inline, strict alignment is enabled, and console output is
               disabled via src/blosc_r.c.

src/lz4/       LZ4 1.9.4, Copyright (c) 2011-2020 Yann Collet,
